<title>SWITZERLAND: UBS sets trading buy for SMH bearer stock.</title>
<headline>UBS sets trading buy for SMH bearer stock.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS said it was recommending a trading buy for bearer shares of Swiss watchmaker Ste Suisse Microelectronique et d'Horlogerie SA (SMH) and had set its price target at 1,000 Swiss francs.</p>
<p>UBS still rated SMH registered shares as hold, &quot;but the recommendation for bearer shares is a trading buy because the 17.6 percent discount to registered shares is unjustified,&quot; analyst Eric Steinhauser said in a research note.</p>
<p>&quot;The price target is 1,000 Swiss francs.&quot;</p>
<p>SMH bearers were down 12 francs at 880 around 1340 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
